Changed the menu. LLM Usage, Agent Runs, Agent Tool Calls and Ticket Embeddings are now below AI Tools, in the Event Tracker AI group.
Changed two field names of an MCP tool in filters and the API. `mutating` is now `writable`, and `server` is now `mcp_server`.
Changed a tool call to an MCP server that uses the `sse` or `stdio` transport. The app refuses the call and names the transport.
